Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.55,0:00:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没多想过我会怎样死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd never given much thought to how I would die.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.96,0:00:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但为心爱的人而死 似乎是个不错的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}But dying in the place of someone I love seems like a good way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.49,0:01:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我不能后悔我做了离家的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I can't bring myself to regret the decision to leave home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.40,0:01:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会想念凤凰城的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would miss Phoenix.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.60,0:01:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会想念那里的热浪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd miss the heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.61,0:01:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会想念我那善变而又粗心大意的妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would miss my loving, erratic, harebrained mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.55,0:01:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.15,0:01:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他的新丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Renee, come on. And her new husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.78,0:01:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 我爱你们 但我们要赶飞机呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, come on. I love you both. We got a plane to catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.62,0:01:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们要出行 所以我要跟我爸住上一段时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they want to go on the road, so I'm gonna spend some time with my dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.66,0:01:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是件好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this will be a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.36,0:01:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.64,0:02:10.35,Title,0,0,0,0,,《暮光之城》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.06,0:02:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,在华盛顿州\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the state of Washington,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.53,0:02:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,在乌云骤雨下\N{\fnArial\fs30}under a near constant cover of clouds and rain,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.56,0:02:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个叫霍克斯的小镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's a small town named Forks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.03,0:02:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,人口3120\N{\fnArial\fs30}Population, 3, 120 people.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.67,0:02:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要搬去这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where I'm moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.84,0:02:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸叫查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad's Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.31,0:02:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是位警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the chief of police.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.99,0:02:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你头发长了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your hair's longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.36,0:02:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,上一次见你后就没剪过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cut it since the last time I saw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.43,0:02:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,长得挺快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess it grew out again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.28,0:03:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前每个夏天都在这里住上两个星期\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to spend two weeks here almost every summer,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.48,0:03:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那是很多年前的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's been years.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.46,0:03:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把架子从浴室里拿走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've cleared some shelves off in the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.43,0:03:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 只有一个浴室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. One bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.74,0:03:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个台灯挺不错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a pretty good work lamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.04,0:03:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,销售小姐帮我挑了个好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sales lady picked out the bed stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.01,0:03:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢紫色 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like purple, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.62,0:03:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,紫色挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Purple's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.98,0:03:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.69,0:03:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.00,0:04:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理的其中一个优点是\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the best things about Charlie,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.10,0:04:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不缠人\N{\fnArial\fs30}he doesn't hover.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.51,0:04:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到你车的声音了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heard you guys coming all the way down the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.41,0:04:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.82,0:04:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 贝拉 你记得比利·布莱克吧 - 记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bella, you remember Billy Black. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.72,0:04:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你精神很好啊 - 我还能跳舞呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wow, you're looking good. - Well, I'm still dancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.29,0:04:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,真高兴你过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you're finally here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.02,0:04:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理知道你要过来后 嘴就没停过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie here hasn't shut up about it since you told him you were coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.49,0:04:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再这么扯我把你推进泥浆里\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, keep exaggerating. I'll roll you into the mud.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.46,0:04:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我先撞断你的腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}After I ram you in the ankles.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.37,0:04:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你来真的吗 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You want to go? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.03,0:04:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,放马过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.34,0:04:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 我叫雅各布 - 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi, I'm Jacob. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.34,0:04:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们小时候一起玩过家家的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We used to make mud pies when we were little.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.17,0:04:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. No, I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.18,0:04:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们总是那么好玩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are they always like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.85,0:04:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老了就没那么能玩了 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's getting worse with old age. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.78,0:04:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.42,0:04:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.22,0:04:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的回家礼物 - 这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your homecoming present. - This?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.16,0:05:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 刚从比利那里买的 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just bought it off Billy here. - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.09,0:05:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我把引擎重新装好了 - 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I totally rebuilt the engine for you. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.20,0:05:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my gosh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.93,0:05:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了 不是在开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is perfect. Are you joking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.80,0:05:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.24,0:05:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过她会喜欢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you she'd love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.21,0:05:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最了解小孩的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm down with the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.18,0:05:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 对 你最棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, dude. You're the bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.74,0:05:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.71,0:05:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,换档时要多扭一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, you gotta double-pump the clutch when you shift,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.92,0:05:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他应该没什么问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}but besides that, you should be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.15,0:05:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这里吗 - 对 就这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's this one? - Yeah. Yeah, right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.45,0:05:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.79,0:05:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,要去学校看看吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want a ride to school or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.86,0:05:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在保留区的学校上学\N{\fnArial\fs30}I go to school on the reservation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.19,0:05:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right, right. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.40,0:05:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那太遭了 一个认识的人都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's too bad. It would've been nice to know one person.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.04,0:05:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我第一天去新学校上学\N{\fnArial\fs30}My first day at a new school.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.11,0:05:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是三月 学期中\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's March, middle of the semester.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.68,0:05:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.72,0:06:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 靓车啊 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice ride. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.93,0:06:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莎贝拉·斯旺 新同学\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Isabella Swan, the new girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.00,0:06:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我叫埃里克 这里的地头虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, I'm Eric, the eyes and ears of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.40,0:06:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么需要吗 导游 午餐约会 男朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything you need, tour guide, lunch date, shoulder to cry on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.35,0:06:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我是个沉默寡言的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really kind of the more suffer-in-silence type.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.75,0:06:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你可以做报纸专题啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good headline for your feature.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.85,0:06:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是报社的 你很有新闻价值 可以上头版\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on the paper, and you're news, baby, front page.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.59,0:06:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.36,0:06:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 请不要有任何\N{\fnArial\fs30}You… Please don't have any sort of…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.26,0:06:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松点 那就不上报纸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chillax. No feature.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.00,0:06:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 谢谢 - 那没事啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, thanks. - Cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.53,0:06:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Okay. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.64,0:06:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,接住 接住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it! Get it! Get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.61,0:06:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}To you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.34,0:06:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.78,0:06:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.91,0:07:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫他们别让我上场的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told them not to let me play.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.58,0:07:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 那 没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way. No, no, no. That's… That's… Don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.02,0:07:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是伊莎贝拉 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Isabella, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.52,0:07:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫我贝拉就可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.05,0:07:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我叫麦克·纽顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Hey, I'm Mike Newton.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.52,0:07:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很高兴认识你 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice to meet you. - Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.72,0:07:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她挺大力的 是吗 - 是啊 只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's got a great spike, huh? - Yeah, it's…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.06,0:07:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫杰西卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Jessica, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.86,0:07:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从亚利桑那州来的 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you're from Arizona, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.86,0:07:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.27,0:07:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚利桑那州的人皮肤不是棕褐色的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't people from Arizona supposed to be, like, really tan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.07,0:07:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.20,0:07:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他们踢我出校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe that's why they kicked me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.31,0:07:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真幽默\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.01,0:07:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,很搞笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's so funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.52,0:07:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰西 回来 - 在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Back in, Jess. - Down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.99,0:07:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一件惊世巨作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a masterpiece, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.32,0:07:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,金字塔重天而降\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll have, like, this crazy pyramid fall from the sky,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.66,0:07:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们可以 - 我很荣幸 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and then you guys can… - It's my pleasure, Madame.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.66,0:07:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们到时就可以互相拍掌庆贺了 - 老友 要玉米卷吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You guys can give each other high fives. - Burrito, my friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.86,0:07:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 麦克 你见过我的小妞贝拉了 - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Mikey! You met my home girl, Bella? - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.70,0:07:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的小妞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your home girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.97,0:07:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.03,0:07:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是 - 我的小妞\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's… - My girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.27,0:07:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思抢了你头彩 麦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry I had to mess up your game, Mike!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.80,0:08:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是泰勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tyler.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.77,0:08:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.34,0:08:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像又回到一年级了 你是他们的新宠\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like first grade all over again. You're the shiny new toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.78,0:08:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,笑一笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.45,0:08:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 - 不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.78,0:08:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,要找个好学生做报纸专题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed a candid for the feature.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.25,0:08:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,安吉拉 不做专题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The feature's dead, Angela.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.72,0:08:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再提这个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't bring it up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.09,0:08:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.26,0:08:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 我挺你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got your back, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.59,0:08:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概这一期我又要写青少年嗜酒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess we'll just run another editorial on teen drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.86,0:08:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实你可以写饮食障碍症啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you can always go for eating disorders.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.57,0:08:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者游泳队里的皇牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speedo padding on the swim team.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.57,0:08:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这主意很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, that's a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.20,0:08:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗 柯克 我也这么想 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kirk. Right? That's exactly what I thought. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.37,0:08:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说得是奥运级人马\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're talking Olympic-size.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.61,0:08:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能 他太瘦了 不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way. He's so skinny. It doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.78,0:08:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 绝对不可能 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Totally. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.98,0:08:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.09,0:08:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,库伦家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Cullens.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.75,0:08:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是库伦医生和他妻子收养的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're Dr. And Mrs. Cullen's foster kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.32,0:08:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,几年前 他们从阿拉斯加搬过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They moved down here from Alaska, like, a few years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.93,0:09:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都独来独往\N{\fnArial\fs30}They kind of keep to themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.13,0:09:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 他们整天在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, 'Cause they're all together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.13,0:09:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,形影不离 朝见口晚见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, together, together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.84,0:09:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个金发女郎叫罗莎莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blonde girl, that's Rosalie,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.47,0:09:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个黑发大个子叫艾米特 他们简直是连体婴\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the big dark-haired guy, Emmett, they're, like, a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.14,0:09:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不确定这样子有没有犯法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not even sure that's legal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.68,0:09:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰西 因为他们不是亲生兄妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jess, they're not actually related.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.11,0:09:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们住在一起啊 感觉很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but they live together. It's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.85,0:09:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个深色头发的女孩叫爱丽丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, okay, the little dark-haired girl's Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.55,0:09:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是个十足的怪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's really weird,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.52,0:09:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,她跟贾斯珀在一起 那个样子好像很痛苦的金发男\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she's with Jasper, the blond one who looks like he's in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.76,0:09:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,库伦医生这个养父像开婚姻介绍所似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Cullen's like this foster dadlmatchmaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.54,0:09:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许他会收养我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he'll adopt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.67,0:09:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's he?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.41,0:09:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是爱德华·库伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Edward Cullen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.28,0:09:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显 他就一大帅哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's totally gorgeous, obviously,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.15,0:09:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但明显这里没人配得上他\N{\fnArial\fs30}but apparently nobody here's good enough for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.42,0:10:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不管呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I care, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.36,0:10:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.40,0:10:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 你别浪费时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, like, don't waste your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.30,0:10:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没这个打算\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't planning on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.48,0:10:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莫列那老师 - 嘿 麦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. Molina. - Hey, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.61,0:10:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯旺小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes. Miss Swan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.43,0:10:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我看看听课证 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Can I have the pass? Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.87,0:10:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎你来上课 这是你的课本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the class. Here. Here's your stuff, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.27,0:10:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我留了个位给你 这边来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I got a seat for you right here, so come over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.01,0:10:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,空着那个 专心听课很快就能跟上\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last one. Just follow along till you catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.41,0:10:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 今天我们观察涡虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, guys, today we are gonna be observing the behavior of planaria,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.58,0:10:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,它又叫扁虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}aka flatworms.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.48,0:10:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what we're gonna do…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.85,0:11:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,让它再生\N{\fnArial\fs30}…regenerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.96,0:11:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,僵尸虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zombie worms.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.36,0:11:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,别玩手机 同学们 开始动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No cell phones. Guys, let's get to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.10,0:11:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,在某些部位要轻点 轻点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentle, gentle, certain areas.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.93,0:11:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别切这里 不是切这里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please just don't cut here. We don't cut here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.77,0:11:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不会相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.24,0:11:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,做的时候要专心 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's try to focus while we check those out, huh, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.79,0:11:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该还有开别的课的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There must be something open.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.19,0:11:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 物理 生物化学 - 没了 课程全都满了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Physics? Biochem? - No, every class is full.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.99,0:11:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a minute, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.63,0:11:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕你还是要继续上生物课了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid you'll have to stay in biology.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.73,0:11:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好 那我只能忍受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. Just… I'll just have to endure it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.22,0:12:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你长那么大了 还那么漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just can't get over how grown up you are. And so gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.59,0:12:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.69,0:12:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.56,0:12:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一年我扮圣诞老人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I played Santa one year.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.76,0:12:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟伦 她四岁开始就没在这里过圣诞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Waylon, she hasn't had a Christmas here since she was four.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.00,0:12:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我会给她留下印象的 没有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet I made an impression, though, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.20,0:12:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你一直都有 - 股沟圣诞老人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You always do. - Butt-crack Santa?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.30,0:12:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们都喜欢这些小瓶子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, kids love those little bottles, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.37,0:12:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 别阻着她吃田园汉堡 伟伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let the girl eat her garden burger, Waylon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.68,0:12:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃完后还有你最爱吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as you're done, I will bring you your favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.18,0:12:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,浆果馅饼 记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Berry cobbler, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.08,0:12:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸爸还经常吃 每个星期四都来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad still has it. Every Thursday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.08,0:12:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 那太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. That'd be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.89,0:12:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.72,0:12:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.90,0:13:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 如果春季训练进行顺利的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, baby. So, listen, if spring training goes well,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.74,0:13:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会搬去佛罗里达\N{\fnArial\fs30}we could be moving to Florida.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.97,0:13:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,请投币1.25美元 延长3分钟通话时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please insert $1.25 for an additional three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.14,0:13:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 你的手机呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, where's your cell?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.41,0:13:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,别笑我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, don't laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.94,0:13:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我弄掉充电器的 它自己跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't lose my power cord. It ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.62,0:13:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,笑吧 我现在正式抵制高科技\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screaming. I literally repel technology now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.55,0:13:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想你 - 宝贝 我也想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I miss you. - Oh, baby, I miss you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.09,0:13:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我学校的事情 那里的小孩是怎么样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But tell me more about your school. Now, what are the kids like?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.46,0:13:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有帅哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are there any cute guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.59,0:13:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们对你好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are they being nice to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.66,0:13:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.27,0:13:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都很友好\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're all very welcoming.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.20,0:13:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me all about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.74,0:13:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有什么关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't even matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.51,0:13:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,有的 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it does, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.77,0:13:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要做作业 下次再聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have homework to do. I'll talk to you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.94,0:13:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.41,0:13:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.22,0:13:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打算与他对质 问他到底有什么问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I planned to confront him and demand to know what his problem was.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.47,0:14:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他没出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he never showed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.61,0:14:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bella!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.59,0:14:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二天 也没出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the next day, another no-show.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.00,0:14:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,日子一天天过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}More days passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.20,0:14:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情变得有点怪异\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things were getting a little strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.72,0:15:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 - 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You all right? - Yeah, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.39,0:15:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,结了冰地面更滑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ice doesn't really help the uncoordinated.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.29,0:15:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 所以我帮你的车换了新轮胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. That's why I had some new tires put on the truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.03,0:15:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,旧得都快磨平了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old ones were getting pretty bald.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.87,0:15:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚可能要晚点回家吃饭 我要去梅森郡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, probably be late for dinner. I gotta head down to Mason County.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.94,0:15:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,格里森姆工厂的保安被野兽咬死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Security guard at the Grisham Mill got killed by some kind of animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.94,0:15:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,野兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}An animal?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.68,0:15:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 这里不是凤凰城\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not in Phoenix anymore, Bells.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.35,0:15:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该去帮帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, I figured I'd lend a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.52,0:16:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小心 - 我一直都很小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Be careful. - Always am.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.29,0:16:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你帮我换轮胎 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And thanks for the tires. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.47,0:16:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,舞协都是些琐碎事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prom Committee is a chick thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.97,0:16:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我总得在校报上给他们写个报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I gotta cover it for the paper anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.94,0:16:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们需要人帮忙挑选音乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they need a guy to help choose the music,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.78,0:16:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我要你的音乐名单\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I need your play list.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.88,0:16:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我在想你有没有约\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, listen, I was wondering, did you have a date to…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.48,0:16:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样 亚利桑那\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up, Arizona? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.29,0:16:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜欢下雨天吗 小妞\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you liking the rain, girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.29,0:16:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好适应它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better get used to it, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.46,0:16:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 麦克 你真可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Mike, hey, you're real cute, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.29,0:16:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 我知道 - 你真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, I know… - That was really awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.53,0:16:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为啥扫我兴了 也让我玩玩嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why you shooting down my game? Let a playa play.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.90,0:16:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 你要玩什么 儿童棒球吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, okay. What you playing at, T-Ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.48,0:16:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.44,0:17:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 上星期没机会自我介绍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I didn't get a chance to introduce myself last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.58,0:17:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫爱德华·库伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Edward Cullen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.58,0:17:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Bella?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.19,0:17:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.35,0:17:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,洋葱根尖细胞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Onion root tip cells,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.16,0:17:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你们的玻璃片上\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's what's on your slides right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.96,0:17:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白 分别标上各个分裂阶段\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? So, separate and label them into the phases of mitosis,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.23,0:17:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,最快完成的小组就能赢得这个金洋葱\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the first partners that get it right are gonna win the Golden Onion.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.07,0:17:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士优先\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.58,0:17:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没来上课\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.55,0:17:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.18,0:17:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那几天我出城了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was out of town for a couple of days.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.75,0:17:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,办些私事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Personal reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.49,0:17:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,前期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prophase.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.26,0:17:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以看看吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you mind if I look?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.36,0:17:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是分裂前期\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's prophase.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.87,0:17:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如我所说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.01,0:18:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢下雨天吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So are you enjoying the rain?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.11,0:18:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.48,0:18:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你问我天气的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're asking me about the weather?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.85,0:18:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.85,0:18:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.76,0:18:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢下雨天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't really like the rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.63,0:18:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不喜欢任何潮湿 阴冷的东西 我真的不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any cold, wet thing, I don't really…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.77,0:18:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.81,0:18:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是后期了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's anaphase.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.14,0:18:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能看看吗 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You mind if I check? - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.06,0:18:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,后期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anaphase.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.89,0:18:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如我所说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.56,0:19:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你那么讨厌寒冷的下雨\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you hate the cold and the rain so much,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.46,0:19:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要搬到美国最潮湿的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}why'd you move to the wettest place in the continental US?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.27,0:19:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,很难说清\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.71,0:19:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能跟得上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure I can keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.22,0:19:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈妈再婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom remarried, and…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.82,0:19:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你不喜欢她的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you don't like the guy, or…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.16,0:19:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's not…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.56,0:19:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲尔对我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phil's really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.34,0:19:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是中期 你要看看吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's metaphase. You want to check it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.55,0:19:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.98,0:19:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不跟你妈妈和菲尔一起住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you move with your mother and Phil?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.02,0:20:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲尔是二级联盟棒球队队员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Phil's a minor league baseball player,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.99,0:20:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要经常到处走\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he travels a lot,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.96,0:20:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我妈妈要留在家陪我 但那样子她不开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my mom stayed home with me, but I knew it made her unhappy,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.43,0:20:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我觉得我要来跟我爸住一阵子\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I figured I'd stay with my dad for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.90,0:20:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在轮到你不开心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you're unhappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.67,0:20:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 对不起 我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - I'm sorry, I'm just…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.88,0:20:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想了解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just trying to figure you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.71,0:20:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的很难读懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're very difficult for me to read.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.22,0:20:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你戴隐形眼镜了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, did you get contacts?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.52,0:20:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.89,0:20:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次见你 你眼睛是黑色的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your eyes were black the last time I saw you,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.22,0:20:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在变成了金褐色\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now they're, like, golden brown.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.26,0:20:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 我知道 是因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know, it's the…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.83,0:20:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些荧光灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the fluorescents.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.25,0:21:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 贝拉 - 贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bella! - Bella!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.09,0:21:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,报警\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dial 911!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.16,0:21:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经报了 他们很快就派人过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already called. They're gonna send somebody over soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.19,0:21:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 对不起 我吓呆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bella, I'm so sorry. I panicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.83,0:21:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 我报警了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bella, I've got 911 on the phone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.84,0:21:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bella. You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.64,0:22:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下再找你 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I are gonna talk. You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.11,0:22:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 没事 别紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine, Dad. Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.98,0:22:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 贝拉 我试过刹车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Bella. I tried to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.48,0:22:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.62,0:22:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 肯定有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. It sure as hell is not okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.42,0:22:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 不是他的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, it wasn't his fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.62,0:22:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你差点没命了 知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could've been killed. You understand that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.75,0:22:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道 但我还在 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. But I wasn't, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.99,0:22:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你的驾照说再见吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can kiss your license goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.76,0:22:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我听说警长的女儿在这里 - 库伦医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I heard the chief's daughter was here. - Dr. Cullen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.46,0:22:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.20,0:22:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰姬 交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got this one, Jackie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.40,0:22:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莎贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isabella.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.50,0:22:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.91,0:22:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 看来你受惊了 感觉怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Bella, looks like you took quite a spill. How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.91,0:22:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.84,0:22:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.21,0:22:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你或许会有些创伤后遗症 或者方向感失调\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might experience some post-traumatic stress or disorientation,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.32,0:22:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你各方面都良好\N{\fnArial\fs30}but your vitals look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.29,0:22:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有任何头部创伤迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}No signs of any head trauma.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.45,0:22:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为你会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you'll be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.06,0:22:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很对不起 贝拉 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry, Bella. I'm really…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.79,0:22:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果爱德华不在现场的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it would've been a whole lot worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.96,0:22:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就糟糕了 是他把我推开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}if Edward wasn't there. He knocked me out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.90,0:22:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德华 你的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edward? Your boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.60,0:22:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 很神奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it was amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.04,0:23:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一下子就来到我面前 他本来离我很远的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he got to me so fast. He was nowhere near me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.87,0:23:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说你很幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like you were very lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.04,0:23:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.41,0:23:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要签些文件 你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta go sign some paperwork. You should…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.28,0:23:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该给你妈打个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should probably call your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.79,0:23:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉她了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you tell her?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.26,0:23:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有可能会\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's probably just.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.33,0:23:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,吓坏她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}freaking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.20,0:23:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少15个人看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifteen kids that saw what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.67,0:23:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我应该怎么做 看着她被撞死\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was I supposed to do, then? Let her die?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.30,0:23:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是你一个人的事 这关系到我们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't just about you. It's about all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.07,0:23:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,回我办公室说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we should take this in my office.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.91,0:23:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能跟你谈谈吗 - 罗莎莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can I talk to you for a minute? - Rosalie.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.98,0:23:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.72,0:23:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能一下子就来我到面前的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you get over to me so fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.16,0:23:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 我就站在你旁边啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was standing right next to you, Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.69,0:24:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你站在你的车旁边 在停车场对面\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You were next to your car, across the lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.10,0:24:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.14,0:24:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 你是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.41,0:24:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 你 你撞到头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bella, you're… You hit your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.84,0:24:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你搞混了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.68,0:24:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很清楚我看到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.18,0:24:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那究竟看到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what exactly was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.15,0:24:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.25,0:24:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,把车顶住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stopped the van.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.75,0:24:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一手把车推开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You pushed it away with your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.39,0:24:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人会相信你 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, nobody's gonna believe you, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.40,0:24:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没打算告诉任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't gonna tell anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.30,0:24:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想知道真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need to know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.74,0:24:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不能感谢我 然后把它抛诸脑后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't you just thank me and get over it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.94,0:24:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.91,0:24:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你就要弄个究竟 是吗 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're not gonna let this go, are you? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.71,0:24:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我希望你能享受这失败感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then I hope you enjoy disappointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.28,0:25:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我第一次梦见爱德华·库伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that was the first night I dreamt of Edward Cullen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.22,0:25:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都出示乘车证 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need everybody's permission slips, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.92,0:25:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 萨米 帮我收起来 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sammy, please collect them. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.72,0:25:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,同学们 我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.53,0:25:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, get in. In. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.57,0:25:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你 还活生生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you, huh? You're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.91,0:25:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道 只是虚惊一场吧 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know, yeah. False alarm, I guess. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.41,0:26:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想问问你 你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I wanted to ask you, you know, if, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.85,0:26:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一个月就到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's like a month away, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.02,0:26:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要不要跟我一起去舞会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you wanna go to prom with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.69,0:26:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.40,0:26:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 你会去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- About what? - Do you want to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.84,0:26:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,舞会\N{\fnArial\fs30}To prom?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.34,0:26:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}With me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.61,0:26:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.47,0:26:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,舞会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prom.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.61,0:26:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.58,0:26:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说不是个好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not such a good idea for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.52,0:26:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个周末我有别的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have something that weekend anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.92,0:26:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去杰克逊维尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to Jacksonville that weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.92,0:26:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能在别的周末去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't go another weekend?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.96,0:26:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,车票不能退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Non-refundable ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.66,0:26:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去问问杰西卡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should ask Jessica.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.79,0:26:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道她想跟你去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know she wants to go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.83,0:26:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.80,0:26:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 同学们 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, yo, yo. Hey, guys, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.30,0:26:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要走了 绿色代表什么 美好的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta go. We gotta go. Green is what? Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.50,0:26:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要走了 同学们 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. Guys, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.44,0:27:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边的车 我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other bus, other bus. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.18,0:27:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛋壳 萝卜头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Egg shells, carrot tops.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.81,0:27:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,混合肥料可是好东西 埃里克 塞进里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Compost is cool. Now, stuff that in there, Eric.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.51,0:27:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 先生 - 很好 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, sir. Yes, sir. - Very good, very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.08,0:27:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我要冲一杯热气腾腾的混合肥料茶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I am gonna make a steaming cup of compost tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.79,0:27:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 - 给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Give me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.96,0:27:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,同学们 这是最基本的循环再用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. This is recycling in its most basic form, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.93,0:27:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,别喝啊 是给植物喝的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't drink it! It's for the plants.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.23,0:27:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,去杰克逊维尔干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's in Jacksonville?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.27,0:27:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.54,0:27:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没回答我的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't answer my question.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.01,0:27:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也没回答我的问题 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't answer any of mine, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.84,0:27:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说你都不跟我打个招呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you don't even say hi to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.88,0:27:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.78,0:27:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意告诉我 你是怎样顶住那台车了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna tell me how you stopped the van?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.45,0:27:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我肾上腺素狂飙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I had an adrenaline rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.92,0:27:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,很正常的 你上谷歌搜索一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very common. You can Google it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.43,0:27:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗罗里达人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Floridians.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.20,0:27:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在杰克逊维尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what's in Jacksonville.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.07,0:27:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能走路带带眼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you at least watch where you walk?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.84,0:28:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我知道我一直很粗鲁 我以为这是最好的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm sorry I'm being rude all the time. I just think it's the best way.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.68,0:28:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 猜猜谁邀请我去舞会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bella! Guess who just asked me to prom.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.95,0:28:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.75,0:28:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直以为麦克会邀请你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I actually totally thought that Mike was gonna ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.82,0:28:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这样子不会尴尬吗 - 不 尴尬值为零\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's not gonna be weird, though, right? - No. Zero weirdness.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.06,0:28:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们在一起很配 - 真的 我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You guys are great together. - I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.06,0:28:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 泰勒 - 恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tyler… - Gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.03,0:28:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 看 是条虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bella, look. It's a worm.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.20,0:28:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是条虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a worm.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.67,0:28:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 我们不能做朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bella, we shouldn't be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.81,0:28:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该早就意识到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really should've figured that out a little earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.94,0:28:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你就不让那台车撞死我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, why didn't you just let the van crush me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.61,0:28:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样你就不用后悔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and save yourself all this regret?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.18,0:28:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我后悔救了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you think I regret saving you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.09,0:28:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看得出 我只是 不知道为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see that you do. I just… I don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.56,0:28:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一无所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.23,0:28:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.93,0:29:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要跟我们一起坐吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna be riding with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.16,0:29:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们的车满座了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, our bus is full.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.17,0:29:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈又打过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mom called. Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.15,0:29:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.21,0:29:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不应该告诉她那场“还差一点”的意外 吃完了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't have told her about the "almost" accident. You finished?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.92,0:29:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.88,0:29:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次你对了 她总是过分担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I suppose you're right. She always did know how to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.32,0:29:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,她跟以前不同了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She seems different.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.09,0:29:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,她开心了很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}She seems happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.10,0:29:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲尔应该是个挺好的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phil sounds like an all right guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.17,0:29:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 他是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.51,0:29:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.64,0:29:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你要戴手套 你要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you need the mitts. You need them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.85,0:29:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 为什么要跟我吵 你就是要戴\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, why do you keep arguing with me? You just need them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.32,0:29:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会得冻疮的 - 我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're gonna get frostbite! - I don't even know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.66,0:30:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.29,0:30:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拉普什啊 宝贝 你加入吗 - 能告诉我什么意思吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- La Push, baby. You in? - Should I know what that means?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.13,0:30:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎鲁特保留区的拉普什海滩 我们打算明天去\N{\fnArial\fs30}La Push Beach down at the Quileute Rez. We're all going tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.73,0:30:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 刚好有大浪来 - 我会的不只是上网冲浪哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, there's a big swell coming in. - And I don't just surf the Internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.00,0:30:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃里克 你只能站起来一次 而且用的还是泡沫冲浪板\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eric, you stood up once, and it was a foam board.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.34,0:30:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能看鲸鱼啊 一齐去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's whale watching, too. Come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.77,0:30:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉普什啊 宝贝 拉普什\N{\fnArial\fs30}La Push, baby. It's La Push.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.31,0:30:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你闭嘴我就去 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'll go if you stop saying that, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.38,0:30:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 很恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, dude. It's creepy, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.01,0:30:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 它就叫那名字 - 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? That's what it's called. - So…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.48,0:30:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,食品艺术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edible art?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.25,0:30:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.75,0:30:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.16,0:30:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忽冷忽热 这样会伤我感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, your mood swings are kind of giving me whiplash.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.56,0:30:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是说我们不做朋友会更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only said it'd be better if we weren't friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.20,0:30:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我不想跟你交朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}not that I didn't wanna be.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.70,0:30:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.07,0:30:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思是如果你聪明的话 就别惹我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means if you were smart, you'd stay away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.47,0:30:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那当作我不聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, let's say for argument's sake that I'm not smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.71,0:30:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能告诉我真相吗 - 不 不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Would you tell me the truth? - No, probably not.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.01,0:30:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想听听你的理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd rather hear your theories.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.62,0:31:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have considered.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.85,0:31:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,辐射蜘蛛 超人原素\N{\fnArial\fs30}radioactive spiders and Kryptonite.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.46,0:31:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是超级英雄漫画里面的东西 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all superhero stuff, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.89,0:31:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我不是英雄呢 如果我是坏蛋呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I'm not the hero? What if I'm the bad guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.06,0:31:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.43,0:31:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看得出你想隐瞒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see what you're trying to put off,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.43,0:31:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看得出你想疏离所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I can see that it's just to keep people away from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.80,0:31:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你戴着副面具\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.38,0:31:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何不一起去玩玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we just hang out?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.21,0:31:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家计划去海滩玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody's going to the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.08,0:31:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.69,0:31:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,来玩玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.99,0:31:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪个海滩 - 拉普什\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Which beach? - La Push.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.83,0:31:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.73,0:31:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.53,0:31:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那海滩有问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there something wrong with that beach?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.97,0:31:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,太拥挤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a little crowded.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.38,0:32:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太冷了 - 我换泳衣了 你还穿外套\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, it's freezing. - I'm paddling out, Coates.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.81,0:32:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不知道来这里有什么意义 - 我们还开车过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know if it's worth it anymore. - We drove all the way out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.48,0:32:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 至少我换泳衣了 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm at least paddling out. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.39,0:32:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她说得对 - 你们都是些小屁孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's right. - You guys are babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.99,0:32:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直想着埃里克邀请我去舞会\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I keep thinking that Eric's gonna ask me to the prom,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.66,0:32:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then he just doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.80,0:32:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该邀请她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should ask him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.77,0:32:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,掌握主动权 你是个坚强的独立女性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take control. You're a strong, independent woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.67,0:32:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是吗 - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I am? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.81,0:32:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 能帮忙拉链吗 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, will you do me up? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.74,0:32:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 贝拉 - 嗨 雅各布\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bella! - Hi, Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.01,0:32:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大家 这是雅各布 - 嘿 你好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Guys, this is Jacob. - Hey, guys. How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.68,0:32:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.95,0:32:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛 跟踪我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you, like, stalking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.05,0:32:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在我们的保留区 忘记了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're on my rez, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.02,0:32:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要滑浪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you surfing?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.02,0:32:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 绝对不要 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Definitely not. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.96,0:32:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们应该陪陪贝拉 她的约会泡汤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys should keep Bella company. Her date bailed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.93,0:32:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}What date?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.06,0:32:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想约爱德华过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}She invited Edward.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.97,0:32:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只是礼貌上邀请一下 - 邀请他很好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- To be polite, that's it. - I think it's nice she invited him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.57,0:33:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没人试过这么做 - 对 库伦就一怪胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nobody ever does. - Yeah, 'Cause Cullen's a freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.17,0:33:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.61,0:33:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们认识他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.31,0:33:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,库伦那伙人不会来这里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Cullens don't come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.72,0:33:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你朋友什么意思 库伦那伙人不会来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did your friends mean about, you know, "The Cullens don't come here?"
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.49,0:33:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你注意到了 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You caught that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.83,0:33:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不该对此说什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not really supposed to say anything about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.90,0:33:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能保守秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I can keep a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.04,0:33:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像一个古老的恐怖故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, it's just like an old scary story.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.47,0:33:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.35,0:33:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 你知道奎鲁特人的祖先是狼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, did you know Quileutes are supposedly descended from wolves?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.55,0:33:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 豺狼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Like, wolves?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.02,0:33:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 真的狼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Like, real wolves?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.06,0:33:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是部落的传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's the legend of our tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.63,0:33:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.73,0:34:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那关库伦家族什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's the story about the Cullens?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.90,0:34:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的祖先是我们的敌对部落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they're supposedly descended from this, like, enemy clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.77,0:34:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾祖父是部落首领 他发现库伦家族在我们的地盘狩猎\N{\fnArial\fs30}My great grandfather, the chief, found them hunting on our land.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.81,0:34:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们宣称自己异于常人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they claimed to be something different,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.88,0:34:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们和他们订下条约\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we made a treaty with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.65,0:34:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们不踏进奎鲁特人的地盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they promised to stay off Quileute lands,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.32,0:34:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就不向白人揭发他们的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}then we wouldn't expose what they really were to the palefaces.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.86,0:34:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为他们才刚搬过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought they just moved here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.89,0:34:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是刚搬回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or just moved back.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.60,0:34:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.50,0:34:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那条蛇咬我的手 停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}It touched my hand. A snake! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.20,0:34:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他们到底是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what are they really?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.64,0:34:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是个传说 贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a story, Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.81,0:34:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.88,0:34:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛇啊 蛇啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}A snake! A snake!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.83,0:35:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.11,0:35:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉罗德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gerald?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.61,0:35:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉罗德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gerald?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.36,0:35:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.47,0:35:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,外套不错哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.07,0:35:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.27,0:35:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是问这些傻问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's always the same inane questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.24,0:35:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Who are you?"
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.51,0:35:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}"What do you want?"
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.81,0:35:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这里干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Why are you doing this?"
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.95,0:36:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 别玩弄我们的大餐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}James, let's not play with our food.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.02,0:36:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎鲁特传奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quileute Legends.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.40,0:36:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎鲁特传奇相关书籍结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Book result for Quileutes Legends.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.66,0:36:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}Map.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.03,0:36:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会在这里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.84,0:36:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,每逢天气好 库伦家族就消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whenever the weather's nice, the Cullens disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.68,0:37:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 他们逃课了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, do they just ditch?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.44,0:37:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 库伦医生和他太太带他们出外了 徒步旅行 露营之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Dr. And Mrs. Cullen yank them out for, like, hiking and camping and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.22,0:37:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试过叫我父母带我去 但他们不肯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried that out on my parents. Not even close.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.48,0:37:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要埃里克一起去舞会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, I'm going to the prom with Eric.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.35,0:37:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我邀请他 我掌握了主动权 - 我说过你会成功的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I just asked him. I took control. - I told you that would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.12,0:37:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定你要出城吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure you have to go out of town?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.66,0:37:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 一些家事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, it's a little family thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.30,0:37:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们去安吉利斯港购物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we should go shopping in Port Angeles.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.73,0:37:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然靓衫就被买光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}before all the good dresses get cleaned out.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.50,0:37:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,安吉利斯港 我能一起去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Port Angeles? You mind if I come?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.44,0:37:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 我要你给我意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I need your opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.44,0:37:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我喜欢这件 - 很酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I like this one. - That's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.11,0:37:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不喜欢露单肩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, like, I don't know about the one-shoulder thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.51,0:37:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我喜欢这件 - 嗯 我喜欢那些珠饰\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I like this one. - Yeah, I like the beading,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.05,0:37:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 穿上它就不用戴珠宝了 - 杰西 你觉得怎样 淡紫色怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and you wouldn't need jewelry. - Jess, what do you think? Lavender?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.42,0:37:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好看吗 颜色适合我吗 - 我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that good? Is that my color? - I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.39,0:37:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也喜欢深玫瑰色那件\N{\fnArial\fs30}I liked that dusty rose one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.46,0:37:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我喜欢这件 能让我显得丰满\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I like this one. It makes my boobs look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.49,0:37:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.73,0:37:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.56,0:37:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 - 真郁闷\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, God. - That is uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.56,0:37:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.53,0:37:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 你觉得怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bella, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.43,0:38:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.07,0:38:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好看\N{\fnArial\fs30}That looks great.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.94,0:38:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试穿了五件你都觉得好看\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said that about, like, the last five dresses, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.97,0:38:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得全都很好看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought they were all pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.28,0:38:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没什么兴致 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not really into this, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.88,0:38:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我想去书店看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I actually really just want to go to this bookstore.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.55,0:38:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,在餐厅等你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll meet you guys at the restaurant?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.12,0:38:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你确定吗 - 嗯 一会见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you sure? - Yeah, yeah. I'll see you in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.92,0:38:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.59,0:38:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说得对 这件很好看\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's right, though. This looks awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.50,0:38:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.67,0:38:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 晚安 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have a good night. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.00,0:39:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 今天在时装店看到你 - 嘿 你要跑去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Saw you in the dress store. - Hey, where you running to?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.84,0:39:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.07,0:39:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 想怎样 - 她是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's up? - It's my girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.01,0:39:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们好吗 - 看看我们找到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How you guys doing? - Look who we just found.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.74,0:39:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,小妞 嘿 你要去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up, girl? Hey… Where you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.68,0:39:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要去哪里 - 来跟我们喝杯东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are you going? - Come get a drink with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.81,0:39:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 跟我们玩玩 - 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, you should hang out with us. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.22,0:39:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好玩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.62,0:39:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有什么问题 - 她不大愿意哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's the problem? - She doesn't like that, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.09,0:39:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你脸蛋挺不错的 - 别碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're pretty. - Don't touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.55,0:39:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真可爱 - 说真的 一齐玩玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cute. - Really, no. Seriously, you should.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.52,0:39:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.00,0:39:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.23,0:39:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样飞车很危险的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a very dangerous maneuver.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.76,0:40:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要回去把他们的头扯掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should go back there and rip those guys' heads off.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.40,0:40:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.50,0:40:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会明白他们脑子里的肮脏恶心思想\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know the vile, repulsive things they were thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.44,0:40:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.61,0:40:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不难猜出\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not hard to guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.81,0:40:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能说些别的吗 分散我的注意力 不然我会调头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you talk about something else? Distract me so I won't turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.45,0:40:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该系上安全带\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should put your seatbelt on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.15,0:40:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该系上安全带\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should put your seatbelt on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.56,0:40:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我觉得沙拉挺好吃 - 对不起 我刚才\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I thought the salad was pretty good. - Hey, you guys, I'm sorry. I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.20,0:40:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去了哪里 我们留了信息给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where were you? We left you messages.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.80,0:40:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在等你 但我们都饿了 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we waited, but we were, like, starving, so we…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.37,0:40:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我占用了贝拉的晚餐时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry I kept Bella from dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.84,0:40:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我遇上她 然后就一直聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just sort of ran into each other and got talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.61,0:40:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.91,0:40:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们完全理解 这很平常 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we totally understand. I mean, that happens, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.55,0:41:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we were…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.68,0:41:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们要走了 所以 - 那我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We were, yeah, we were just leaving. So… - Let's get this…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.62,0:41:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 如果你要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bella, if you wanna…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.92,0:41:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能让贝拉饿着肚子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I should make sure Bella gets something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.09,0:41:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.19,0:41:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以送你回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll drive you home myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.36,0:41:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,很体贴\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's so thoughtful.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.80,0:41:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 真体贴\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's really thoughtful. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.90,0:41:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我要吃点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I should eat something.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.14,0:41:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.27,0:41:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 那明天见 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, so we'll see you tomorrow. - Okay, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.88,0:41:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再见 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- See ya. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.59,0:41:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,一份蘑菇馄饨\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, one mushroom ravioli.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.82,0:41:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks. - Yeah, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.16,0:41:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的不吃东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So are you sure there isn't anything I can get for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.53,0:41:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.23,0:41:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以随时叫我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.81,0:42:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的不吃吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're really not gonna eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.15,0:42:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我的食谱很特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm on a special diet.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.05,0:42:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得告诉我真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta give me some answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.59,0:42:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.82,0:42:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,得出结果是\N{\fnArial\fs30}To get to the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.83,0:42:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,1.77245\N{\fnArial\fs30}1.77245…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.83,0:42:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想知道圆周率的平方根是多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to know what the square root of pi is.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.23,0:42:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew that?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.00,0:42:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我在那里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know where I was?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.20,0:42:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.87,0:42:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.64,0:42:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,别走 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't leave. I…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.14,0:42:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在跟踪我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you follow me?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.95,0:42:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.32,0:42:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有保护你的欲望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel very protective of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.62,0:42:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你跟踪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you followed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.02,0:42:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尝试跟你保持距离 除非你需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was trying to keep a distance unless you needed my help,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.09,0:42:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我听到那些贱人的思想\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then I heard what those low-lifes were thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.40,0:42:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.37,0:43:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你听到他们的思想\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say you heard what they were thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.31,0:43:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what, you…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.14,0:43:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂读心术\N{\fnArial\fs30}You read minds?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.75,0:43:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能读懂这餐厅里所有人的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can read every mind in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.55,0:43:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但就读不懂你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apart from yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.29,0:43:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,金钱 性\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's money, sex,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.43,0:43:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,金钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}money,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.56,0:43:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,性\N{\fnArial\fs30}sex,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.16,0:43:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.40,0:43:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你 什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.11,0:43:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,令我很沮丧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very frustrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.68,0:43:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有什么问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there something wrong with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.48,0:43:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你我懂得读心\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I tell you I can read minds,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.75,0:43:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你认为你自己有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you think there's something wrong with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.36,0:44:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.50,0:44:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经没有力量离开你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have the strength to stay away from you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.81,0:44:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就别离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.06,0:44:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我够暖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I think I'm warm enough now.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.10,0:44:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的手很冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your hand is so cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.05,0:44:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.15,0:44:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.55,0:45:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸还在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad's still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.59,0:45:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能停车吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you pull in?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.96,0:45:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,最边那台是我爸的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my father's car on the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.86,0:45:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来这里干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is he doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.63,0:45:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡莱尔 发生什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carlisle, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.37,0:45:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在附近的一条小艇上发现伟伦·霍杰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waylon Forge was found in a boat out near his place.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.58,0:45:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我刚验尸了 - 他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I just examined the body. - He died?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.71,0:45:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么 - 野兽袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How? - Animal attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.42,0:45:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是杀死梅森郡的保安的那头野兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it the same one that got that security guard down in Mason?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.69,0:45:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.02,0:45:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那尽量不要离开小镇 - 贝拉 你应该进去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, it's getting closer to town, then. - Bella, you should go inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.93,0:45:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟伦是你爸的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waylon was your father's friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.50,0:45:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.37,0:45:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,一会见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.31,0:46:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.99,0:46:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 我很难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.49,0:46:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识他有30年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've known him going on 30 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.14,0:46:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 我们会把凶手找出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, we're gonna find this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.21,0:46:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meantime,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.92,0:46:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你带着这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to carry this with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.79,0:46:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果你觉得 - 让你老爸安心一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know if you… - It'll give your old man some peace of mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.03,0:46:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.56,0:46:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.85,0:47:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷血动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cold One.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.17,0:47:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷血动物 吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Cold One: Apotamkin.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.06,0:47:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃及\N{\fnArial\fs30}EGYPT.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.93,0:47:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃及人 长生水\N{\fnArial\fs30}EGYPTIANS: The Immortal Drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.06,0:47:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,印度\N{\fnArial\fs30}INDIA.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.15,0:48:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,恒河瘟疫\N{\fnArial\fs30}SCOURGE OF THE GANGES.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.61,0:48:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,秘鲁\N{\fnArial\fs30}PERU.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.61,0:48:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,分尸魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}THE DEMON'S DISMEMBERMENT.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.95,0:48:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不死\N{\fnArial\fs30}undead.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.53,0:48:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.79,0:48:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.79,0:48:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮肤冰冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}cold-skinned.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.26,0:48:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,永生\N{\fnArial\fs30}IMMORTAL.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.59,0:48:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}drank blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.44,0:49:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的速度和力量超乎常人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're impossibly fast and strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.58,0:49:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的身体苍白冰冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your skin is pale white and ice-cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.45,0:49:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的眼睛会变色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your eyes change color.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.32,0:50:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时 你说话的语气 好像你不属于这个时代\N{\fnArial\fs30}And sometimes you speak like you're from a different time.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.26,0:50:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从来不吃不喝 你从不出现在有阳光的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never eat or drink anything. You don't go out in the sunlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.56,0:50:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你多大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How old are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.63,0:50:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,17岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seventeen.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.37,0:50:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你停留在17岁多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long have you been 17?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.98,0:50:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}A while.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.42,0:50:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.76,0:50:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,说出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.70,0:50:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,大声说出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.00,0:50:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.28,0:50:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.02,0:51:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你害怕吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you afraid?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.83,0:51:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.50,0:51:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那问我个最基本的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then ask me the most basic question.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.53,0:51:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们吃什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.17,0:51:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会伤害我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.91,0:51:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.95,0:51:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,上山\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.18,0:51:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,云堤之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of the cloud bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.22,0:51:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要看看我在阳光下的模样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to see what I look like in the sunlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.51,0:52:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们不出现在阳光下\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is why we don't show ourselves in sunlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.14,0:52:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会知道我们与众不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}People would know we're different.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.79,0:52:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.00,0:52:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,像闪耀的钻石\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like diamonds.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.51,0:52:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很美\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.38,0:52:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.01,0:52:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是杀人狂的皮肤 贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the skin of a killer, Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.16,0:52:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个杀人狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.79,0:52:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.36,0:52:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你相信谎言\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's because you believe the lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.56,0:52:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只是掩饰\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's camouflage.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.50,0:53:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是世上最危险的食肉兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the world's most dangerous predator.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.17,0:53:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我全身上下都在引诱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything about me invites you in,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.91,0:53:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的声音 我的脸孔 甚至是我的气味\N{\fnArial\fs30}my voice, my face, even my smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.31,0:53:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我引诱你才这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}As if I would need any of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.55,0:53:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像你速度比我快似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}As if you could outrun me!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.46,0:53:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像你能打赢我似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}As if you could fight me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.17,0:53:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个天生杀人狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm designed to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.00,0:53:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.51,0:53:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀过人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've killed people before.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.41,0:53:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It does not matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.88,0:53:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.22,0:53:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,对人类的鲜血 我从没有过这么大的欲望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never wanted a human's blood so much in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.93,0:54:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.97,0:54:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.60,0:54:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里 我相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here. I trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.11,0:54:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的家庭跟其他同类不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}My family, we're different from others of our kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.41,0:54:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只会猎杀动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}We only hunt animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.25,0:54:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们学会了怎样控制我们的欲望\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've learned to control our thirst.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.58,0:54:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你 你的气息\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's you, your scent,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.82,0:54:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说就好像是毒品\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's like a drug to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.46,0:54:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就像我专有的海洛因\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're like my own personal brand of heroin.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.34,0:54:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那初次见我时 你为什么那么讨厌我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you hate me so much when we met?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.57,0:54:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.34,0:54:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,但却令我越想拥有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only for making me want you so badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.68,0:54:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还不知道我能不能控制自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still don't know if I can control myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.62,0:54:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.69,0:55:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能读懂你的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't read your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.43,0:55:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要告诉我你的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to tell me what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.87,0:55:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我害怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.57,0:55:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.04,0:55:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我害怕的不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not afraid of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.72,0:55:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我害怕失去你 我感觉你很快就会消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm only afraid of losing you. I feel like you're gonna disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.93,0:55:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道我等了你多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know how long I've waited for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.14,0:55:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,狮子爱上了羔羊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the lion fell in love with the lamb.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.58,0:55:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,多么愚蠢的羔羊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a stupid lamb.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.48,0:56:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,多么病态的受虐狂狮子\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a sick, masochistic lion.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.67,0:57:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,有三件事我是肯定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}About three things I was absolutely positive.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.14,0:57:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一\N{\fnArial\fs30}First,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.61,0:57:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德华是吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edward was a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.01,0:57:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Second,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.08,0:57:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他体内的那部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}there was a part of him,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.09,0:57:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对我鲜血的饥渴\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I didn't know how dominant that part might be,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.72,0:57:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道占据了他身体多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thirsted for my blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.86,0:57:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三\N{\fnArial\fs30}And third,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.43,0:58:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我毫无无条件地 义无反顾地爱上了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was unconditionally and irrevocably in love with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.87,0:58:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒙特卡洛 那就是舞会的主题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monte Carlo? That's our prom theme?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.04,0:58:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,赌钱 礼服 还有007 邦德 詹姆斯·邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gambling, tuxedos, and Bond, James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.69,0:58:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.90,0:58:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都盯着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, everybody's staring.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.17,0:58:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙不算 他望一下而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that guy. No, he just looked.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.98,0:58:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经破戒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm breaking all the rules now anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.85,0:58:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正也要下地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since I'm going to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.39,0:58:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人一定要垂死\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, does a person have to be dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.76,0:59:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,才会变成你那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}to become like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.23,0:59:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是卡莱尔咬的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's just Carlisle.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.77,0:59:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他从来不强迫人家\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd never do this to someone who had another choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.81,0:59:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你成为吸血鬼多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how long have you been like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.44,0:59:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,从1918年开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since 1918.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.84,0:59:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡莱尔发现我将死于西班牙流感\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's when Carlisle found me dying of Spanish influenza.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.72,0:59:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was it like?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.05,0:59:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那毒液令人痛苦万分\N{\fnArial\fs30}The venom was excruciating.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.12,0:59:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但卡莱尔要承受更多的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what Carlisle did was much harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.36,0:59:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之中没多少个有他那样的控制力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not many of us have the restraint to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.89,0:59:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是咬一下就可以了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But didn't he just have to bite?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.80,0:59:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.83,0:59:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们尝了人血后\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.74,0:59:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,就一发不可收拾\N{\fnArial\fs30}human blood, a sort of frenzy begins,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.68,0:59:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,几乎不可能停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's almost impossible to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.38,0:59:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但卡莱尔成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Carlisle did.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.18,0:59:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,先是我 然后是他妻子埃斯米\N{\fnArial\fs30}First with me and then with his wife, Esme.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.09,1:00:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以卡莱尔就是你不杀人的真正原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}So is Carlisle the real reason that you don't kill people?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.29,1:00:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不只是因为他\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he's not the only reason.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.10,1:00:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想成为一头怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to be a monster.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.44,1:00:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的家人自喻为素食主义者\N{\fnArial\fs30}My family, we think of ourselves as vegetarians, right,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.64,1:00:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们只吸动物的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause we only survive on the blood of animals.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.04,1:00:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那就像\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.35,1:00:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人一辈子只吃豆腐\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a human only living on tofu.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.12,1:00:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,它能让你身体健康 但你永远也得不到满足\N{\fnArial\fs30}It keeps you strong, but you're never fully satisfied.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.76,1:00:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但吸你的血就大不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wouldn't be like drinking your blood, for instance.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.60,1:00:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟伦是被其他吸血鬼杀的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it other vampires that killed Waylon?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.74,1:00:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.07,1:00:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面也有其他吸血鬼 我们不时会遇上他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are others out there, and we run into them from time to time.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.31,1:00:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你家族其他成员 也像你那样懂读心术的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can the rest of your family read people's minds like you can?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.32,1:01:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 只有我会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. That's just me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.95,1:01:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但爱丽丝能预见未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Alice can see the future.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.82,1:01:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我猜她知道我会来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet she saw me coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.16,1:01:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱丽丝预见的未来是很主观的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice's visions are subjective.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.03,1:01:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来往往是可以改变的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the future can always change.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.28,1:01:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能像个人样吗 我有邻居在的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you act human? I mean, I've got neighbors.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.08,1:01:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天我要带你去我家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna take you to my place tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.42,1:01:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.28,1:01:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 见你的家人 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait, like, with your family? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.52,1:01:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们不喜欢我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if they don't like me?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.56,1:01:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是担心你要跟满屋子的吸血鬼在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're worried not because you'll be in a house full of vampires,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.23,1:01:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是担心他们不承认你\N{\fnArial\fs30}but because you think they won't approve of you?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.67,1:01:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样也能逗你开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad I amuse you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.14,1:01:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.01,1:01:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Complication.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.64,1:02:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天来接你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll pick you up tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.47,1:02:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 过来探望你的车吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Come to visit your truck?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.57,1:02:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来挺好 凹面修好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks good. Got that dent out.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.08,1:02:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 其实我们是来看电视的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Actually, we came to visit your flat-screen.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.78,1:02:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,水手队本季第一场比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}First Mariners game of the season.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.08,1:02:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅各布又嚷着要见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus Jacob here keeps bugging me about seeing you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.89,1:02:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 爸爸 谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great, Dad. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.89,1:02:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子 只是说实话嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keeping it real, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.46,1:02:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,维生素R\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vitamin R.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.29,1:02:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done, Chief.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.09,1:02:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利家自制的炸鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harry Clearwater's homemade fish fry.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.56,1:02:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good man.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.43,1:03:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟伦案件有进展吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any luck with that Waylon case?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.30,1:03:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为他不是被野兽杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't think it was an animal that killed him.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.17,1:03:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都不认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never thought it was.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.74,1:03:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,在保留区有把话传出去了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So spread the word out at the rez, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.54,1:03:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让孩子走进树林里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep the kids out of the woods.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.18,1:03:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will do.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.28,1:03:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不想再有任何人受到伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't want no one else getting hurt, do we?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.00,1:03:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.33,1:03:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.20,1:03:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么宽敞明亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so light and open, you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.51,1:04:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想看到什么 棺材 地牢还是壕沟\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you expect, coffins and dungeons and moats?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.01,1:04:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 没想到壕沟\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not the moats.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.41,1:04:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到壕沟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the moats.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.76,1:04:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这里不用遮遮掩掩\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the one place we don't have to hide.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.26,1:04:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过他们别这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told them not to do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.16,1:04:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,在不粘锅里 加上一点橄榄油\N{\fnArial\fs30}You add a little bit of olive oil to a non-stick saute pan,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.90,1:04:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧到七八成热\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you want to cook with the olive oil in medium-high heat.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.37,1:04:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这个切成条 然后我们切这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I do, I cut this in strips, and then we gonna cut this…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.21,1:04:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她是意大利人 - 她叫贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is she even Italian? - Her name is Bella.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.41,1:04:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定不管什么她都会喜欢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure she'll love it, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.45,1:04:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,闻一下那个气味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a whiff of that.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.82,1:04:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人类来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here comes the human.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.82,1:04:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 我们在做意大利菜给你吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bella, we're making Italiano for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.63,1:04:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 这是埃斯米 一眼能就看出是我妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bella, this is Esme. My mother for all intents and purposes.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.77,1:05:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给了我们第一次使用厨房的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've given us an excuse to use the kitchen for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.14,1:05:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你饿了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you're hungry.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.37,1:05:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 当然 - 她吃过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, absolutely. - She already ate.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.41,1:05:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.31,1:05:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我知道你们不吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's just because I know that you guys don't eat…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.39,1:05:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 你考虑挺周到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. It's very considerate of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.95,1:05:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别理罗莎莉 我不管她的 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just ignore Rosalie. I do. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.59,1:05:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就继续假装 她不会危害到我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just keep pretending like this isn't dangerous for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.83,1:05:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会对别人说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would never tell anybody anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.06,1:05:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She knows that.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.90,1:05:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 问题是你们俩公开在一起了 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, the problem is, you two have gone public now, so…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.07,1:05:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾米特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emmett.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.14,1:05:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她应该知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she should know.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.91,1:05:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们出了问题 整个家族都会被牵连\N{\fnArial\fs30}The entire family will be implicated if this ends badly.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.11,1:05:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Badly, as in…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.41,1:05:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我变成一顿大餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would become the meal.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.16,1:05:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Bella.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.36,1:06:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是爱丽丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Alice.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.80,1:06:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.97,1:06:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你闻上去的确不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do smell good.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.94,1:06:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱丽丝 你要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice, what are you…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.17,1:06:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 我和贝拉会成为好朋友的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. Bella and I are gonna be great friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.98,1:06:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 贾斯珀刚刚开始吃素\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Jasper's our newest vegetarian.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.51,1:06:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,对他来说还有些困难\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a little difficult for him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.68,1:06:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a pleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.65,1:06:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 贾斯珀 你不会伤害她\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, Jasper. You won't hurt her.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.92,1:06:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我想带你去别的地方看一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'm gonna take you on a tour of the rest of the house.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.63,1:06:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 - 好 待会见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Well, I'll see you soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.99,1:06:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.20,1:06:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真可爱 - 我也觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cute! - I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.33,1:06:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看进展得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that went well.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.63,1:06:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上把这清理了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clean this up. Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.10,1:06:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得很奇怪 你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that as weird for you as it was for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.31,1:06:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.78,1:06:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕业帽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Graduation caps?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.62,1:07:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 一个内部笑话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. It's a private joke.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.35,1:07:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们上过很多次学\N{\fnArial\fs30}We matriculate a lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.82,1:07:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's kind of miserable.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.79,1:07:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直重复念高中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, repeating high school over and over.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.73,1:07:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错 但我们在一个地方装得越年轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}True, but the younger we start out in a new place,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.90,1:07:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就可以在那地方待越久\N{\fnArial\fs30}the longer we can stay there.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.10,1:07:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,来这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.88,1:07:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, this is my room.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.63,1:07:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有床\N{\fnArial\fs30}No bed?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.56,1:07:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.90,1:07:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.30,1:07:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 从不 - 不 完全不睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ever? - No, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.84,1:07:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.55,1:08:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有好多唱片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, you have so much music.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.62,1:08:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都听什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you listening to?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.29,1:08:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是德布西的曲子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Debussy.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.29,1:08:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不懂 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know… - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.00,1:08:23.30,Title,0,0,0,0,,《月光女神》很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire De Lune is great.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.94,1:09:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 我不会跳舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - I can't dance.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.02,1:09:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 我能带你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I could always make you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.55,1:09:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不怕你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not scared of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.93,1:09:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you really shouldn't have said that.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.23,1:09:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好抓紧点 蜘蛛猴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better hold on tight, spider monkey.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.21,1:09:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you trust me?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.48,1:09:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,理论上\N{\fnArial\fs30}In theory.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.65,1:09:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么闭上眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.11,1:10:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.74,1:10:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't real.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.01,1:10:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种事情根本不存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}This kind of stuff just doesn't exist.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.68,1:10:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我的世界里就存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}It does in my world.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.37,1:11:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,停一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.11,1:11:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's human.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.65,1:12:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚利桑那女 怎么样啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arizona. Yo, what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.09,1:12:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和库伦一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you and Cullen, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.19,1:12:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那 我不喜欢那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's… I don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.46,1:12:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I don't know,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.19,1:12:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看你的时候 好像想吃了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}he just looks at you like you're something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.07,1:12:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的素菜 斯蒂芬妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's your veggie plate, Stephenie.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.10,1:12:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我迟到了 在忙生物课作业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, sorry I'm late. Biology project.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.84,1:12:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你点了菠菜沙拉 希望你喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ordered you the spinach salad. I hope that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.78,1:12:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次你应该给你自己点一份\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should order one for yourself next time.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.88,1:12:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,少吃点牛排\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut back on the steak.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.25,1:12:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我像马儿一样健康\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm as healthy as a horse.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.52,1:12:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,说点什么吧 警官 大家都想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say, Chief, boys want to know,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.42,1:12:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们沿着奎茨河有什么发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}did you find anything down by Queets River today?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.49,1:12:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我们找到一个人的脚印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we found a bare human footprint,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.03,1:12:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是谁的 看上去他向东面走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it looks like whoever that is, is headed east,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.47,1:12:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以基萨普县的长官会着手调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}so Kitsap County sheriff is gonna take over from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.30,1:12:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.04,1:12:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是希望尽快抓住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just hope they catch him fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.72,1:13:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的朋友好像在给你打信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like your friends are flagging you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.35,1:13:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去就去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay if you wanna go join them.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.15,1:13:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想早点回去休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just gonna turn in early anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.89,1:13:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.33,1:13:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 星期五啦 出去玩吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bella, it's Friday night. Go out.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.83,1:13:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个叫纽顿的孩子好像很喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like the Newton boy's got a big smile for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.36,1:13:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 他是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he's a good buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.30,1:13:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,镇上别的臭小子怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about any of these other yahoos in town?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.67,1:13:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人对你感兴趣吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody interest you?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.17,1:13:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 我们要谈男孩的事情吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, we gonna talk about boys?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.81,1:13:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I guess not.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.21,1:13:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是觉得常常丢下你一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just feel like I leave you alone too much.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.92,1:13:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该和人多接触\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be around people.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.35,1:13:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不介意一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't really mind being alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.32,1:13:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这点上我跟爸爸挺像的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I'm kind of like my dad in that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.83,1:13:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那棒球队怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how's all the baseball stuff going?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.87,1:13:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲尔在很努力地训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phil's working so hard.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.24,1:13:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 正在春训\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, spring training.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.77,1:14:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在找房子 以便能长住\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're looking for a house to rent in case things become more permanent.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.81,1:14:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会喜欢杰克逊维尔的 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd like Jacksonville, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.21,1:14:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.78,1:14:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢上霍克斯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really liking Forks.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.81,1:14:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.78,1:14:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我越来越喜欢霍克斯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forks is growing on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.65,1:14:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是跟哪个男生有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could a guy have anything to do with that?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.59,1:14:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.99,1:14:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道 告诉我吧 他是做什么的 运动员 歌手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it. Tell me everything. What is he? Jock? Indie?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.89,1:14:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜他一定很聪明 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet he's smart. Is he smart?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.27,1:14:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 下次再跟你说好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, can I talk to you later?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.63,1:14:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,别 我正在谈男孩呢 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, we gotta talk boys. Are you being safe?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.08,1:14:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you get in here?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.41,1:14:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,从窗口\N{\fnArial\fs30}The window.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.41,1:14:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你经常那样子的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you do that a lot?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.28,1:14:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是过去那几个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, just the past couple of months.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.86,1:14:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢看你睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like watching you sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.63,1:14:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,令我神魂颠倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of fascinating to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.73,1:15:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直想尝试一件事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always want to try one thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.31,1:15:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,呆着别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stay very still.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.25,1:15:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.69,1:16:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.73,1:16:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.07,1:16:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意志力比我想象中要强\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm stronger than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.84,1:16:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 希望你能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I wish I could say the same.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.14,1:16:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你在一起时 我绝对不能失控\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't ever lose control with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.02,1:16:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, don't go.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.40,1:17:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再给你一罐 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, got you another one. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.11,1:17:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和爱德华·库伦有约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a date with Edward Cullen.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.81,1:17:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你来说 他有点老了 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a little old for you, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.81,1:17:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.51,1:17:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他三年级 我也三年级\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a junior. I'm a junior.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.48,1:17:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你喜欢库伦他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you liked the Cullens.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.19,1:17:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你不喜欢这个镇上的男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you didn't like any of the boys in town.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.92,1:17:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德华不住在镇上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edward doesn't live in town.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.83,1:17:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,严格地说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Technically.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.06,1:17:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's right outside.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.27,1:17:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.77,1:17:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想正式见你一面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he wanted to meet you, officially.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.01,1:17:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 带他进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Bring him in.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.31,1:18:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能友好一点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you be nice?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.15,1:18:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对我很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's important.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.36,1:18:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯旺警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chief Swan.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.99,1:18:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想正式自我介绍 我叫爱德华·库伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to formally introduce myself. I'm Edward Cullen.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.43,1:18:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 爱德华\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Edward.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.77,1:18:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 今晚不会太晚回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bella won't be out too late tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.10,1:18:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只是和我家人去打棒球\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's just gonna play baseball with my family.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.54,1:18:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,棒球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baseball?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.61,1:18:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 就这个节目\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir, that's the plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.57,1:18:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉要打棒球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bella's gonna play baseball.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.91,1:18:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, good luck with that.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.68,1:18:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会照顾她的 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take good care of her. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.52,1:18:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.85,1:18:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡椒喷雾还有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still got that pepper spray?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.86,1:18:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,有啊 爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.53,1:18:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸血鬼什么时候开始喜欢棒球了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And since when do vampires like baseball?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.33,1:18:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是美国人的消遣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's the American pastime,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.13,1:18:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷雨就要来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there's a thunderstorm coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.77,1:19:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们唯一能玩的时候 你会知道原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only time we can play. You'll see why.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.75,1:19:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.85,1:19:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴你来 我们需要一个裁判\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad you're here. We need an umpire.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.92,1:19:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,她觉得我们会作弊\N{\fnArial\fs30}She thinks we cheat.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.52,1:19:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你会作弊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you cheat.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.99,1:19:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看到了就喊出来 贝拉 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Call them as you see them, Bella. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.47,1:19:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.22,1:19:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我知道为什么你们需要闪电了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, now I see why you need the thunder.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.69,1:19:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,本垒打 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's gotta be a home run, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.46,1:19:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德华的动作可快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edward's very fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.64,1:20:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,回本垒 罗莎莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come home, Rosalie!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.41,1:20:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你出局了 - 出局\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're out. - Out!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.38,1:20:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 别这样 只是场游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Babe, come on. It's just a game.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.59,1:20:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,打得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice kitty.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.71,1:20:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.40,1:21:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好个猴人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My monkey man.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.58,1:21:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.20,1:21:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们正要离开 后来听到了我们的动静\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were leaving. Then they heard us.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.00,1:21:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们走 - 太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go. - It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.50,1:21:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的头发披下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your hair down.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.54,1:21:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那有用吗 我在球场另一边都闻得到她的气味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like that'll help. I can smell her from across the field.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.18,1:21:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不该带你到这来 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shouldn't have brought you here. I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.22,1:22:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 你要 - 别出声 站在我身后\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? What are you… - Just be quiet and stand behind me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.24,1:22:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这个球是你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe this belongs to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.75,1:22:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.88,1:22:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫劳伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Laurent.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.82,1:22:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是维多利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is Victoria.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.32,1:22:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,和詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}and James.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.79,1:22:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是卡莱尔 这是我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Carlisle. This is my family.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.13,1:22:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.46,1:22:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我担心你们的狩猎活动 给我们造成了一点麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid your hunting activities have caused something of a mess for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.37,1:22:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our apologies.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.27,1:22:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道这片地方已经有主了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't realize the territory had been claimed.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.04,1:22:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在附近享有永久居留权\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, well, we maintain a permanent residence nearby.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.34,1:22:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.58,1:23:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们不会惹麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we won't be a problem anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.62,1:23:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是路过\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were just passing through.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.62,1:23:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类追踪我们 但是我们把他们引到东面去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The humans were tracking us, but we led them east.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.52,1:23:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们应该安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.86,1:23:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.19,1:23:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.86,1:23:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要不要加三个选手\N{\fnArial\fs30}could you use three more players?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.10,1:23:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 不就是场游戏嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Just one game.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.27,1:23:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 当然好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. Why not?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.24,1:23:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些人正要走 你们可以替他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few of us were leaving. You could take their place.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.77,1:23:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先击球\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll bat first.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.38,1:23:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能投出漂亮的曲线球\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the one with the wicked curveball.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.74,1:23:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我想我们能应付\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think we can handle that.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.65,1:23:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们倒要看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall see.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.37,1:24:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带了份点心来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You brought a snack.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.81,1:24:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}A human?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.51,1:24:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个女孩和我们一起的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl is with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.41,1:24:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们最好离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it best if you leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.39,1:24:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道游戏结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see the game is over.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.46,1:24:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll go now.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.23,1:24:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}James.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.77,1:24:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,带贝拉离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get Bella out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.98,1:24:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.45,1:24:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我知道了 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I've got it! I've got it! I'm all right!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.16,1:24:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 他现在要追杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, now he's coming after me?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.47,1:25:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 詹姆斯 是追踪猎手 他最喜欢捕猎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me. James is a tracker. The hunt is his obsession.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.37,1:25:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我读了他的想法 我在球场上的反应刺激了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I read his mind. My reaction on the field set him off.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.34,1:25:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我令他觉得这是他生平最刺激的游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just made this his most exciting game ever.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.75,1:25:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他从不罢手 - 我们现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's never gonna stop. - What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.38,1:25:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只能杀了他 把他撕碎 烧成灰烬\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to kill him. Rip him apart and burn the pieces.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.22,1:25:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们去哪 - 离开霍克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where we going? - Away from Forks.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.99,1:25:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们要坐船去温哥华 - 我现在要回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We'll get a ferry to Vancouver. - I have to go home. Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.96,1:25:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要带我回家 - 你不能回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have to take me home. - You can't go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.43,1:25:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会追踪你的气味 你家是他的第一目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just gonna trace your scent there. It's the first place he's gonna look.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.43,1:25:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是我爸爸在那 我们 - 没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But my dad is there. We… - It doesn't matter!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.57,1:25:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,有关系 他会因为我们而被杀害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it does! He could get killed because of us!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.80,1:25:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,就让我带你先离开这 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let me get you out of here first, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.74,1:25:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我爸爸 我们要回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my dad! We have to go back!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.54,1:25:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能想出办法 把那追踪猎手引开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll figure a way to lead the tracker away somehow.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.38,1:25:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道怎样 但是我们得想办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. But we have to do something.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.25,1:25:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爱德华 我说过别理我 - 贝拉 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Edward, I said leave me alone. - Bella, don't do this, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.99,1:25:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都完了 出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over! Get out!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.62,1:25:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨嗨嗨嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.22,1:26:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bella? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.99,1:26:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要离开这里 我要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just gotta get out of here. I'm leaving now.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.03,1:26:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.24,1:26:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bella?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.00,1:26:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要跟他说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I gonna say to him?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.57,1:26:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能伤害他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't hurt him.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.68,1:26:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 贝拉 发生了什么 - 你一定要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bella, what's going on? - You just have to.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.25,1:26:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去卡车上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be down at the truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.59,1:26:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他伤害你了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he hurt you?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.92,1:26:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,没\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.43,1:26:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你分手了还是怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Break up with you or something?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.76,1:26:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我甩了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I broke up with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.23,1:26:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你喜欢他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you liked him.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.77,1:26:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 所以我才要走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's why I have to leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.74,1:26:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想这样 我要回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want this. I have to go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.24,1:26:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,回家 你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home? Your…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.75,1:26:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈都不在凤凰城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mom's not even in Phoenix.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.25,1:26:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会回家的 我会在路上给他打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll come home. I'll call her from the road.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.98,1:27:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用马上就开车回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna drive home right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.35,1:27:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先睡一觉 早上你还想走的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can sleep on it. If you still feel like going in the morning,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.72,1:27:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会送你去机场的 - 不 我就要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll take you to the airport. - No. I want to drive.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.42,1:27:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样我有更多时间思考\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll give me more time to think.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.36,1:27:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我累了 我保证会去旅馆休息的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, if I get really tired, I'll pull into a motel. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.26,1:27:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 贝拉 我知道跟我一起住很无趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Bella, I know I'm not that much fun to be around,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.30,1:27:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我能改 我们可以一起做很多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I can change that. We can do more stuff together.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.87,1:27:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like what?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.27,1:27:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,看电视上的棒球赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like watch baseball on the flat-screen?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.08,1:27:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天晚上一起吃饭 牛排和水果馅饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat at the diner every night? Steak and cobbler?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.91,1:27:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 那是你 不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, that's you. That's not me.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.75,1:27:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 别这样 我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bella, come on, I just…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.55,1:27:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想你留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just got you back.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.53,1:27:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 但你知道吗 如果我现在不走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and, you know, if I don't get out now,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.76,1:27:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就会像妈妈一样困在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}then I'm just gonna be stuck here like Mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.16,1:28:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸会原谅你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father's gonna forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.89,1:28:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来开吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you let me drive?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.90,1:28:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.44,1:28:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该看看他的神情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should've seen his face.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.41,1:28:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟他说了我妈走的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told him the same thing that my mom told him.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.24,1:28:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他说的那些话\N{\fnArial\fs30}when she was leaving him.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.94,1:28:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是让他放你走的唯一办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only way he'd let you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.28,1:28:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不用担心他了 他很安全 追踪猎手跟着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just don't worry about him now. He's safe. The tracker's following us.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.42,1:28:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 天哪 - 是艾米特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, God. - It's just Emmett.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.76,1:28:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱丽丝的车就跟在我们后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice is in the car behind us.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.75,1:29:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.99,1:29:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来警告我们提防詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}He came to warn us about James.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.82,1:29:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我要挑衅 我已经厌倦了他的游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't my fight, and I've grown tired of his games,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.89,1:29:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他有超凡出众的能力 绝对致命\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he's got unparalleled senses, absolutely lethal.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.90,1:29:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,300年来我从没见过像他那样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen anything like him in my 300 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.97,1:29:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个女人 维多利亚 不要低估她\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the woman, Victoria, don't underestimate her.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.81,1:29:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经和同类战斗过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had to fight our kind before.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.08,1:29:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要杀死他们不简单 - 但不是不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're not easy to kill. - But not impossible.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.51,1:29:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把他们撕成碎片 烧成灰烬\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll tear them apart and burn the pieces.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.68,1:29:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢杀害其他生物的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't relish the thought of killing another creature,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.65,1:29:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使是嗜血成性的詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}even a sadistic one like James.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.25,1:29:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要是他先杀了我们中的一个呢 - 我要带贝拉向南逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What if he kills one of us first? - I'm gonna run Bella south.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.62,1:29:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能把猎手引开吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you lead the tracker away from here?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.86,1:29:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 爱德华 詹姆斯知道你不会离开贝拉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Edward. James knows you would never leave Bella.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.86,1:29:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他会跟着你 - 我和贝拉一起走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He'll follow you. - I'll go with Bella.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.96,1:30:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和贾斯珀开车带她南下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jasper and I will drive her south.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.13,1:30:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证她的安全 爱德华\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll keep her safe, Edward.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.53,1:30:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能保证你自己吗 - 能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you keep your thoughts to yourself? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.44,1:30:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗莎莉 埃斯米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosalie, Esme,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.41,1:30:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们能穿上这个吗 追踪者会跟着贝拉的气味\N{\fnArial\fs30}could you put these on so the tracker will pick up Bella's scent?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.75,1:30:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,凭什么 她是我什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? What is she to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.18,1:30:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗莎莉 贝拉和爱德华在一起的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosalie, Bella is with Edward.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.12,1:30:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,她现在是这个家的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's part of this family now,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.86,1:30:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要保护我们的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we protect our family.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.51,1:30:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,天 如果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. If anything…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.71,1:30:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.01,1:30:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有什么事情发生 我会向上帝发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anything happens, I swear to God…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.88,1:30:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing's gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.92,1:30:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有七个人 他们只有两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's seven of us, and there's two of them,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.69,1:31:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情一结束 我就会回来接你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and when everything's done, I'm gonna come back and get you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.42,1:31:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.33,1:31:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 现在起 你就是我的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bella, you are my life now.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.11,1:31:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 妈妈 还是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Mom. It's me again.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.98,1:31:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的电话是挂了还是怎么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must have let your phone die or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.98,1:31:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在霍克斯了 但是一切都好 晚点我会跟你解释的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not in Forks, but everything's okay, and I'll explain it later.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.46,1:31:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗莎莉 在树上蹭一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosalie, mark the tree.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.63,1:31:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.18,1:32:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 你看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it? What do you see?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.43,1:32:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.06,1:32:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,追踪者 他刚刚改了路线\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tracker, he just changed course.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.67,1:32:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他要去哪里 爱丽丝 - 很多镜子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where will it take him, Alice? - Mirrors.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.40,1:32:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个房间的镜子\N{\fnArial\fs30}A room full of mirrors.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.68,1:33:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德华说视像不总是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edward said the visions weren't always certain.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.85,1:33:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,她能看到人们正在走的那条道\N{\fnArial\fs30}She sees the course people are on while they're on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.22,1:33:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们改变了想法 视像就变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they change their minds, the vision changes.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.38,1:33:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 那么追踪者正要去的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so the course that the tracker's on now.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.69,1:33:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一个芭蕾舞蹈房\N{\fnArial\fs30}is gonna lead him to a ballet studio?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.09,1:33:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你去过这里 - 我小时候在那里上课\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You've been here? - I took lessons as a kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.89,1:33:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个学校有个那样的拱顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}The school I went to had an arch just like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.83,1:33:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的学校在凤凰城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was your school here in Phoenix?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.13,1:33:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.13,1:33:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爱德华 你还好吗 - 我们跟丢了追踪者\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Edward, are you okay? - We've lost the tracker.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.10,1:33:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个女的还在这附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}The woman's still in the area.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.74,1:33:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗莎莉和埃斯米回霍克斯保护你爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosalie and Esme are going back to Forks to protect your father.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.41,1:33:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来接你 然后我们单独去别的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming to get you. Then you and I are gonna go somewhere alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.45,1:33:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,别的人去继续找\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the others will keep hunting.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.18,1:33:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无论如何要保护你的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do whatever it takes to make you safe again.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.20,1:33:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 妈妈 我很高兴你收到了我的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Mom, I'm glad you got my message.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.53,1:33:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在家做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing home?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.80,1:33:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 贝拉你在什么地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bella? Bella? Bella, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.40,1:34:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别激动 我很好 - 贝拉 贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Calm down, everything's fine. - Bella? Bella?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.44,1:34:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我晚点会跟你解释的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll explain everything later.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.98,1:34:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 你在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, are you there?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.08,1:34:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍克斯高中不怎么保护学生的隐私\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forks High School doesn't protect its students' privacy very well.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.21,1:34:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,维多利亚轻易地找到了你以前的住址\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just too easy for Victoria to find your previous address.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.58,1:34:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你家的房子不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a nice house you have here.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.09,1:34:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准备等你来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was prepared to wait for you,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.42,1:34:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你妈妈回来了 她接到了你爸的电话 她很担心你\N{\fnArial\fs30}but then Mom came home after she received a very worried call from your dad,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.76,1:34:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都进行得很顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it all worked out quite well.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.90,1:34:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.10,1:34:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要碰她 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch her! Don't…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.47,1:34:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还可以救她 - 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can still save her. - Don't!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.87,1:34:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你要离开你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're gonna have to get away from your friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.14,1:34:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能办到吗 - 我去哪里找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you handle that? - Where should I meet you?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.28,1:34:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前的芭蕾舞教室 怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about your old ballet studio?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.41,1:34:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果让我知道你带了什么人一起的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll know if you bring anyone along.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.25,1:34:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可怜的妈妈就要为这错误付出代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor Mommy would pay the price for that mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.47,1:35:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从未多想我会怎样死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd never given much thought to how I would die.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.34,1:35:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但为心爱的人而死 似乎是个不错的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}But dying in the place of someone I love seems like a good way to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.75,1:35:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不后悔当初的决定 尽管我现在直面死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't bring myself to regret the decisions that brought me face-to-face with death.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.49,1:35:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也因此遇到了爱德华\N{\fnArial\fs30}They also brought me to Edward.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.76,1:36:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 贝拉 贝拉 你在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bella? Bella? Bella, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.06,1:36:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈妈 - 贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mom? - Bella?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.40,1:36:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈妈 - 你在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mom? - There you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.00,1:36:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing in here?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.53,1:36:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都欺负我\N{\fnArial\fs30}YOUNG Everyone makes fun of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.27,1:36:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的舞跳得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, you're a wonderful dancer.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.94,1:36:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 我不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, I suck.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.41,1:36:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not suck.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.12,1:36:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最喜欢那一段\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my favorite part.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.12,1:36:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是倔强的孩子 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were a stubborn child, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.86,1:36:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她不在这 - 不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's not even here. - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.30,1:36:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.10,1:36:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 你把事情变得太容易了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, but you really made it too easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.24,1:36:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我们多找点乐子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So to make things more entertaining,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.14,1:36:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要拍一部我们的电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna make a little film of our time together.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.98,1:36:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我从你家里借来的 希望你别介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I borrowed this from your house. I hope you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.45,1:36:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.68,1:37:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.19,1:37:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}action.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.92,1:37:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会伤了爱德华幼小的心灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll break Edward's little heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.72,1:37:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 爱德华和这事无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have… Edward has nothing to do with this!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.16,1:37:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是肯定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he does.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.86,1:37:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的愤怒会让游戏更加有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}His rage will make for more interesting sport.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.60,1:37:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,远比他对你没用的保护有乐趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}than his feeble attempt to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.37,1:37:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}And let's continue.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.35,1:37:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,太美了 很有视觉冲击力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful. Very visually dynamic.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.66,1:37:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我选了个好舞台\N{\fnArial\fs30}I chose my stage well.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.90,1:37:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不幸 他没有勇气改变你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too bad he didn't have the strength to turn you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.74,1:37:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能让你做一个脆弱渺小的人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead, he kept you this fragile little human.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.54,1:37:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太残忍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's cruel, really.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.18,1:38:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉爱德华有多痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell Edward how much it hurts.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.58,1:38:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫他报仇 告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him to avenge you. Tell him!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.25,1:38:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 爱德华 不要 - 告诉他 告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, Edward, don't! - Tell him! Tell him!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.80,1:38:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你孤身一人 因为你比别人都快\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're alone 'Cause you're faster than the others.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.57,1:38:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是不够强\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not stronger.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.78,1:38:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,足够杀死你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm strong enough to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.02,1:38:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.52,1:39:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 贝拉 没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bella, Bella, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.65,1:39:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son. Enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.89,1:39:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember who you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.70,1:39:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 贝拉 你没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bella, you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.00,1:40:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bella needs you.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.07,1:40:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.83,1:40:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.97,1:40:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡莱尔 她的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carlisle? Her blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.94,1:40:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的兄弟会处理他的 - 我抓住他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your brothers will take care of him. - I got him.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.61,1:40:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡莱尔 - 点火\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carlisle! - Start the fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.94,1:40:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,把地板拿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the floorboards.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.88,1:40:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爱丽丝 - 爱丽丝 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Alice! - Alice, go.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.96,1:40:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的股动脉裂开了 大量失血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her femoral artery's been severed. She's losing too much blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.06,1:40:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 我的头要烧起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, my head is burning!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.80,1:40:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是毒液\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the venom.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.40,1:40:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要做一个决定 你可以改变她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to make a choice. You could let the change happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.24,1:40:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.24,1:40:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.78,1:40:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 会那样子的 爱德华 我看到了 - 不必非得那么做吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's gonna happen, Edward. I've seen it. - It doesn't have to be that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.58,1:40:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还在流血 爱丽丝 给我止血带 你的皮带\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's still hemorrhaging. Alice, make me a tourniquet. Your belt.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.62,1:40:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡莱尔 我还有别的选择吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carlisle, what's my other option?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.19,1:40:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,绑在我手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tie it above my hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.39,1:40:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡莱尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carlisle!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.69,1:41:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.53,1:41:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们可以把毒液吸出来 - 你知道我停不下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We could try to suck the venom out. - You know I won't be able to stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.43,1:41:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,用你的意志停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then find the will to stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.57,1:41:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,做决定吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But choose.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.07,1:41:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没剩多少时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She only has minutes left.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.44,1:41:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让它过去的 贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna make it go away, Bella.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.31,1:41:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让它过去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna make it go away.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.70,1:41:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德华 停 她的血干净了 你会杀死她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edward, stop. Her blood is clean. You're killing her.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.91,1:41:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德华\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edward.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.74,1:41:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.08,1:41:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.81,1:41:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠你的意志\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find the will.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.94,1:42:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡是如此安详 从容\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death is peaceful, easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.55,1:42:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,生活却更加艰辛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life is harder.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.76,1:42:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bella?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.06,1:42:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.90,1:42:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bella.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.97,1:42:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈妈 - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mom? - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.13,1:42:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.74,1:42:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.67,1:42:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德华在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Edward?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.24,1:42:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他睡着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's asleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.94,1:42:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直都没离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}He never leaves.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.28,1:43:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸爸去餐厅了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your dad, he's down at the cafeteria.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.81,1:43:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.02,1:43:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你摔下去的时候 伤到了腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, when you fell, you broke your leg,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.89,1:43:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,流了很多血\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you lost a lot of blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.49,1:43:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都不记得 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't remember any of this, do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.83,1:43:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德华和他爸爸一起过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edward came down with his dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.59,1:43:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,想劝你回霍克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}to try to convince you to come back to Forks.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.10,1:43:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你去他们住的旅馆 后来你就失足跌到\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you went over to their hotel, then you tripped,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.53,1:43:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从两段楼梯上摔下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you fell down two flights of stairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.97,1:43:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,摔过一扇窗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Went through a window.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.08,1:43:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 挺像我的作风\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that sounds like me.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.01,1:43:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 宝贝 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, honey, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.09,1:43:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是菲尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Phil.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.09,1:43:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很担心你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's so worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.56,1:43:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在发短信\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're texting.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.03,1:43:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 终于会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.66,1:43:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让他呆在佛罗里达\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told him to stay down in Florida.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.83,1:43:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 你会喜欢杰克逊维尔的 那里每天阳光灿烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, you are gonna love Jacksonville. It's sunny every day,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:59.97,1:44:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到了最好的房子 你会有自己的浴室\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we found the cutest little house, and you've got your own bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.84,1:44:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 我还是想住在霍克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, I still want to live in Forks.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.04,1:44:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.68,1:44:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想住在霍克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to live in Forks.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.05,1:44:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们再说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, okay, but we'll talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.15,1:44:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以麻烦你叫爸爸来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you mind getting Dad?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.85,1:44:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想跟他道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to talk to him. Apologize.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.46,1:44:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 宝贝 我叫他来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, baby. I'll go get him.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.63,1:44:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我叫护士来 好吗 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And I'll go get a nurse, okay? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.28,1:44:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.28,1:44:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's James?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.01,1:44:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把他处理了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We took care of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.49,1:44:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个女的 维多利亚 她逃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the woman, Victoria, she ran off.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.66,1:44:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我活着是因为你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm alive because of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:56.69,1:44:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 因为我你才躺在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're in here because of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.83,1:45:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,最坏的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The worst part of it was that.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.70,1:45:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我没法停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I wasn't gonna be able to stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.50,1:45:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你停下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.77,1:45:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 你得去杰克逊维尔 那样我才不会伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bella, you gotta go to Jacksonville so I can't hurt you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.71,1:45:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:21.05,1:45:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you… No!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.22,1:45:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.29,1:45:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你是 怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even know what you're… How…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.09,1:45:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么 你要我走 我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about? You want me to go away? I can't…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.99,1:45:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不走 我不要离开你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I can't… I can't just leave you…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.60,1:45:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.83,1:45:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能分开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't be apart.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:38.54,1:45:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能离开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't leave me.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.90,1:45:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.78,1:45:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 只是不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, just don't…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.68,1:45:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能对我说那样的话 永远不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just can't say stuff like that to me. Ever.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.42,1:45:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还能去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where else am I gonna go?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.67,1:46:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱丽丝 借我的这套衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice lent me the dress.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.41,1:46:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个绑腿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cast is…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.98,1:46:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太美了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.31,1:46:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会照顾她的 斯旺警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take care of her, Chief Swan.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.52,1:47:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好像听过这句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've heard that before.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:06.62,1:47:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Bells.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.53,1:47:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在你包里放了一瓶新的胡椒喷雾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put a new can of pepper spray in your bag.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:13.23,1:47:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:14.87,1:47:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.17,1:47:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you look beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:22.74,1:47:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.74,1:47:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.12,1:47:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.62,1:47:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 贝拉 - 雅各布\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bella. - Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.23,1:47:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:44.29,1:47:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 漂亮 - 你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice. - You, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.23,1:47:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是来闯入舞会的吗 你有带女伴来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you crashing the prom or something? Did you come with a date?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.90,1:47:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.01,1:47:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸付我钱跟你讲话\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad paid me to come talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.21,1:48:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,20块\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty bucks.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.94,1:48:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,要说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's hear it.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.45,1:48:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要生气 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just don't get mad, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.05,1:48:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他希望你和你男朋友分手\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants you to break up with your boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.39,1:48:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他说的 要加引号\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just, he said, quote,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.89,1:48:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会关照你\N{\fnArial\fs30}"We'll be watching you."
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.46,1:48:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 跟他说谢谢了 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, well, tell him, "Thanks." - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:21.60,1:48:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有让他付清钱 - 好 我来帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And to pay up. - Okay. Let me help you.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:24.77,1:48:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅各布\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.67,1:48:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来就可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:31.74,1:48:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以后再见 贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess I'll see you around, Bella.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:35.98,1:48:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.35,1:48:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你一个人呆两分钟 狼就来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I leave you alone for two minutes, and the wolves descend.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:55.03,1:48:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不敢相信你让我这样 - 笑一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't believe you're making me do this. - Just smile.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.52,1:49:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 你不如杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. You are really trying to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:21.59,1:49:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,春季舞会是个重要的仪式 我不想你错过任何事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}The prom is an important rite of passage. I didn't want you to miss anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.20,1:49:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.32,1:49:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bella, hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.86,1:50:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要过去吗 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you want to go? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.31,1:50:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.98,1:50:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,当真\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're serious?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:14.71,1:50:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.70,1:50:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 你在跳舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, you're dancing.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.00,1:50:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,舞会上\N{\fnArial\fs30}At prom.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.39,1:50:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德华 你为什么要救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edward, why did you save me?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.89,1:51:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你让毒液扩散\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you just let the venom spread,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:02.93,1:51:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就和你一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could be like you by now.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.93,1:51:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know what you're saying.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:10.33,1:51:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不想这样 - 我想要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't want this. - I want you.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:12.80,1:51:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.74,1:51:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想结束你的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna end your life for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.41,1:51:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已近在死亡的过程中了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm dying already.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.82,1:51:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一秒 都更接近死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every second, I get closer.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.69,1:51:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,变老\N{\fnArial\fs30}Older.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.55,1:51:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情本来就应该这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the way it's supposed to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.96,1:51:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱丽丝 说他看到我像你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice said that she saw me like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.53,1:51:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我听到她说了 - 她的视像会变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I heard her. - Her visions change.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.93,1:51:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 根据人们的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, based on what people decide.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:43.17,1:51:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我决定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've decided.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:48.14,1:51:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你梦寐以求\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's what you dream about.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:50.71,1:51:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为一头怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Becoming a monster.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.05,1:51:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想和你永远在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dream about being with you forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.02,1:52:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forever?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:05.49,1:52:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're ready right now?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.66,1:52:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.91,1:52:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我度过一个漫长而快乐的一生 这样还不够吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it not enough just to have a long and happy life with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.02,1:52:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:42.73,1:52:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,就现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}For now.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:12.62,1:53:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚没有人会放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one will surrender tonight,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.09,1:53:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我不会屈服\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I won't give in.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.26,1:53:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我清楚我要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I want.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:03.84,1:54:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,How come I end up where I started\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come I end up where I started.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:07.11,1:54:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,How come I end up where I went wrong\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come I end up where I went wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:10.21,1:54:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Won't take my eyes off the ball again\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't take my eyes off the ball again.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:13.48,1:54:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,You reel me out then you cut the string\N{\fnArial\fs30}You reel me out then you cut the string.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:22.86,1:54:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,How come I end up where I started\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come I end up where I started.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:26.03,1:54:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,How come I end up where I went wrong\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come I end up where I went wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:29.07,1:54:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Won't take my eyes off the ball again\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't take my eyes off the ball again.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:32.07,1:54:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,First you reel me out and then you cut the string\N{\fnArial\fs30}First you reel me out and then you cut the string.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:47.95,1:54:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,You used to be all right\N{\fnArial\fs30}You used to be all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:51.22,1:54:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,What happened？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.96,1:55:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did the cat get your tongue\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did the cat get your tongue.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.30,1:55:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did your string come undone\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did your string come undone.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.14,1:55:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,One by one\N{\fnArial\fs30}One by one.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:13.44,1:55:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,One by one\N{\fnArial\fs30}One by one.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:18.88,1:55:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,It comes to us all\N{\fnArial\fs30}It comes to us all.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:25.49,1:55:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's as soft as your pillow\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's as soft as your pillow.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:15.91,1:56:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,I dreamed I was missing\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dreamed I was missing.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:18.61,1:56:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,You were so scared\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were so scared.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.74,1:56:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,But no one would listen\N{\fnArial\fs30}But no one would listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:24.58,1:56:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,'Cause no one else cared\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause no one else cared.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:28.08,1:56:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,After my dreaming\N{\fnArial\fs30}After my dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:30.65,1:56:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,I woke with this fear\N{\fnArial\fs30}I woke with this fear.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:34.09,1:56:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,What am I leaving\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I leaving.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:36.56,1:56:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,When I'm done here？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I'm done here?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:39.76,1:56:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,So if you're asking me\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you're asking me.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:42.27,1:56:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want you to know\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:46.17,1:56:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,When my time comes\N{\fnArial\fs30}When my time comes.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:48.30,1:56:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Forget the wrong that I've done\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget the wrong that I've done.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:51.47,1:56:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Help me leave behind some\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me leave behind some.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:54.34,1:56:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Reasons to be missed\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reasons to be missed.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:58.18,1:57:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't resent me\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't resent me.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:00.38,1:57:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,And when you're feeling empty\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when you're feeling empty.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:03.39,1:57:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep me in your memory\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep me in your memory.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:06.32,1:57:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Leave out all the rest\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave out all the rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:09.49,1:57:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Leave out all the rest\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave out all the rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:12.10,1:57:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Forgetting all the hurt inside\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgetting all the hurt inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:15.03,1:57:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've learned to hide so well\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've learned to hide so well.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:18.03,1:57:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pretending someone else can come\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretending someone else can come.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:20.94,1:57:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,And save me from myself\N{\fnArial\fs30}And save me from myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:24.07,1:57:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't be who you are\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't be who you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:28.14,1:57:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,When my time comes\N{\fnArial\fs30}When my time comes.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:30.31,1:57:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Forget the wrong that I've done\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget the wrong that I've done.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:33.42,1:57:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Help me leave behind some\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me leave behind some.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:36.45,1:57:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Reasons to be missed\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reasons to be missed.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:40.19,1:57:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't resent me\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't resent me.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:42.23,1:57:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,And when you're feeling empty\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when you're feeling empty.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:45.43,1:57:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep me in your memory\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep me in your memory.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:48.16,1:57:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Leave out all the rest\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave out all the rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:51.43,1:57:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Leave out all the rest\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave out all the rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:54.07,1:57:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Forgetting all the hurt inside\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgetting all the hurt inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:56.91,1:57:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've learned to hide so well\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've learned to hide so well.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:00.04,1:58:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pretending someone else can come\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretending someone else can come.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:02.81,1:58:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,And save me from myself\N{\fnArial\fs30}And save me from myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:06.08,1:58:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't be who you are\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't be who you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:12.02,1:58:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't be who you are\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't be who you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:24.37,1:58:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,How can I decide what's right\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can I decide what's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:27.27,1:58:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,When you're clouding up my mind\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you're clouding up my mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:30.54,1:58:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't win your losing fight\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't win your losing fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:33.78,1:58:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,All the time\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:35.85,1:58:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,How can I ever own what's mine\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can I ever own what's mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:39.02,1:58:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,When you're always taking sides\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you're always taking sides.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:42.12,1:58:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,But you won't take away my pride\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you won't take away my pride.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:45.12,1:58:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,No not this time\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:51.43,1:58:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,No not this time\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:59.17,1:59:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,How did we get here？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did we get here?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:01.90,1:59:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,When I used to know you so well\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I used to know you so well.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:10.81,1:59:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,But how did we get here？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But how did we get here?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:13.78,1:59:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think I know\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:28.60,1:59:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,The truth is hiding in your eyes\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth is hiding in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:31.80,1:59:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,And its hanging on your tongue\N{\fnArial\fs30}And its hanging on your tongue.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:34.94,1:59:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just boiling in my blood\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just boiling in my blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:37.37,1:59:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,But you think that I can't see\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you think that I can't see.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:40.11,1:59:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,What kind of man that you are\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of man that you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:43.48,1:59:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you're a man at all\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're a man at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:46.58,1:59:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well I will figure this one out on my own\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I will figure this one out on my own.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:54.92,2:00:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm screaming I love you so\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm screaming I love you so.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:00.43,2:00:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,My thoughts you can't decode\N{\fnArial\fs30}My thoughts you can't decode.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:03.43,2:00:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,How did we get here？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did we get here?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:06.44,2:00:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,When I used to know you so well\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I used to know you so well.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:13.48,2:00:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah But how did we get here？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah But how did we get here?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:17.81,2:00:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well I think I know how\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think I know how.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:37.27,2:00:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you see what we've done\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see what we've done.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:43.01,2:00:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're gonna make such fools of ourselves\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna make such fools of ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:50.31,2:00:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,How did we get here？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did we get here?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:53.25,2:00:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,When I used to know you so well\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I used to know you so well.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:57.89,2:01:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah yeah yeah\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:01.92,2:01:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,How did we get here？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did we get here?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:04.86,2:01:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,When I used to know you so well\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I used to know you so well.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:11.90,2:01:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think I know\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I know.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:19.31,2:01:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,There is something I see in you\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is something I see in you.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:25.18,2:01:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,It might kill me\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might kill me.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:27.95,2:01:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want it to be true\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want it to be true.
